@host = http://localhost:8084
@customer = rafa
@orderId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID
@key = prueba-orden-001

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### P1 - Crear orden válida (repetir con la misma key demuestra P4)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "basketId": "{{customer}}"
}

### P2 - Consultar orden
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Órdenes del cliente
GET {{host}}/api/orders/customer/{{customer}}

### P5 - Pending -> Confirmed
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### P6 - Transición inválida (repetir Confirmed o intentar después de Cancelled)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}
